Package: wiringjon
Version: ${VERSION}
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Architecture: ${ARCH}
Depends: libc6, libgpiod2
Conflicts: wiringpi
Provides: wiringpi
Maintainer: wiringJON project <wiringjon@localhost>
Description: wiringPi-compatible GPIO library for the Jetson Orin Nano
 Drop-in replacement for wiringPi on NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano / NX
 Developer Kits, using libgpiod (GPIO character device) instead of
 BCM peripheral registers. Provides libwiringPi, libwiringPiDev,
 headers and the gpio command line utility; programs written for
 wiringPi compile and link unchanged (-lwiringPi -lwiringPiDev).
